## 10. Bonus End

- **feature_trigger_counter** should be increased by 1
- All mystery coins reveal it’s values at the end of the bonus.
- Mystery cannot be revealed or collected during the bonus game, only at the final stage when total win is calculated unless there is level increment in case of Eternal Pot.
- All coin values on the screen summed and multiplied with the applicable multiplier.
- Example, if the row 0 has multiplier 3x and cell index (0,1) has cell multiplier 5x with coin_value = 2x &  global multiplier is 4x (due to eternal pot). Then the cell (0,1) value will be : 2 x 3 x 5 x 4 =120
- Result × bet
- If **no free positions remain**:
    - Bonus game end if Eternal Pot is inactive
    - All coins with will be collected (with applicable multipliers) & screen will be cleared. Level increments and coin drops starts again.

