| Coin Type | Value / Result |
| --- | --- |
| Regular Coin | 1x–9x bet |
| Sticky Coin | x3–x12 bet |
| Jackpot Coin (Mini) | x15 bet |
| Jackpot Coin (Midi) | x50 bet |
| Jackpot Coin (Major) | x100 bet |
